---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About · Nicholas Rode">
  <section class="wrap about reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Motion, product, and the handoff in between.</h1>
    <div class="body">
      <p>
        I started in motion and spent four years as a junior designer under a senior designer,
        working on product UI, prototypes, onboarding, and motion. Today I design interactive
        motion for AI, voice, and data infrastructure products.
      </p>
      <p>
        What I care about most is the handoff: the moment a design leaves my hands and has to
        survive production. That's why I've started building tools with AI. One turns
        rendered animation into lightweight web shaders. The other turns Figma designs into React
        code that developers can rely on.
      </p>
      <p>Outside work: 3D, audio engineering, and hiking with my family and dog.</p>

      <h2 class="eyebrow">Experience</h2>
      <ul class="xp">
        <li><strong>Motion Designer</strong>, Webstacks <span>2025–now</span></li>
        <li>
          <strong>Junior Designer (Product UI & Motion)</strong>, Variable Medium <span>2021–2024</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-top: 48px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 56px);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    max-width: 14em;
    margin: 16px 0 32px;
  }
  .body {
    max-width: 640px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .body h2 {
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .xp {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .xp li {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .xp span {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
